94
00:05:40.317 --> 00:05:43.802
Listening carefully and showing you understand is blank listening.

95
00:05:44.102 --> 00:05:47.524
A, active. B, social. C, self.

96
00:05:51.067 --> 00:05:53.194
The answer is A: active.

97
00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:57.139
Controlling strong feelings is emotional blank.

98
